description:
Principle planning service including the following:

* Report writing undertaken by professional Town Planners employed by Capita;
* Liaison with Council officers as required;
* Monitoring of performance;
* Fixed fees based on the completion of individual applications. Reasonable amendments and corrections are included within the fee for each application;
* Fees relate to application type 
* For each application, the Consultant will:
* Review Planning Register online including application documents, correspondence, drawings, submitted evidence and consultation responses etc;
* Assess evidence;
* Liaise with Council case officers for queries as required;
* Write and return officer report;
* Provide decision recommendation; 
* Submit report and recommendation to Council point-of-contact; and
* Complete and return applications within agreed time frame.
